<head>
<no><b>Schedule 1</b></no><heading
guid="_3ed77a27-7fb5-4a6b-90a2-c08b3e46c061" id="sch.1-he"><b>State
arms</b></heading></head>
<block align="right" type="sourceref"><txt>(Section 3)</txt></block>

<level type="part" id="sch.1-pt.1">
